      "writtenOn": "2024-04-02T16:27:35Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This should probably be extracted to a (non-static) method on VirtualMachine.\nAnd I wonder if you should call it from VMM#importFromDescriptor, outside the create lock, rather than here?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 436,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 444,
